2. Change the units for "1st_random_number" to "     " (i.e., no units),
3. Change the units for "angle_min" to "radians",
4. Set sigv_max to 4.5e-08 (first of the two zeroes at the end of the
   file).
5. Set angle_min (second of the two zeroes). The appropriate value
   is the minimum angle in radians; in almost all cases it should
   correspond to the last entry in the scattering_angle table and
   can be just copied from there. For this case, it is
   0.087266462599714.

NOTE: by virtue of the quantum mechanical indistinguishability of
