ARGON REFLECTION ON IRON
arreflfe.nc

     --Version 1.0--
Generated this file manually using data from BongJu Lee and Mi Joung. The 
reflection coefficient
values were provided by Lee, apparently by a TRIM calculation (dependent
only upon the incident energy). These were interpolated onto a uniform 
mesh by KaleidaGraph and pasted in here. Likewise, the energy reflection
coefficients were provided as a simple table from 1 to 100 eV. These
were interpolated onto a regular mesh and pasted into the file. Note that
the energy independent variable extends to zero to provide a linear
extrapolation at energies much smaller than 1 eV. The exponent in the 
cosine-to-a-power angular distribution (1.8) came from Lee.

