LITHIUM REFLECTION ON CARBON - Li_refl_C
D_refl_vftrim_Li.nc

The current assumption is that Li sticks to C perfectly so that the
only PMI really needed is that for adsorption (Li_adsorb_C).  But,
presently the code still requires a reflection process to work.  
To that end, have added this process, but with an arbitrarily chosen
data file (D_refl_vftrim_Li.nc).  When used, however, the recycling
coefficient for the C material should be set to zero.

